.SH THE MILIEU CODEX
The MILIEU CODEX of Stars is the compendium of known space, containing detailed information about each star system. Knowledge levels range from Unknown (name only) to Intimate (complete secrets).

Systems are organized by territory:
.IP \(bu 2
\fBWestern Alliance\fR: ARVEN (capital), BELIX, CAYRU
.IP \(bu 2
\fBEastern Powers\fR: ZAREK, ASTREX, BRION
.IP \(bu 2
\fBContested Reach\fR: KORAL, QUELL, SYDRA, VARYN, WEXAR, XYLEN, TAVON, and others

Each system entry includes celestial bodies, notable moons, resources, populations, infrastructure, and anomalies.

