.SS Core Decision Functions
Every KHS strategy must implement these functions:

.TP
.B buildShip(credits: int, game: GameState) -> Option<ShipDesign>
Decide whether and what to build given available credits.
Returns \fBNone\fR to skip building, \fBSome(design)\fR to build.

.TP
.B planMovement(ship: Ship, game: GameState) -> MovePlan
Determine where to move a ship. Returns path as list of hex IDs.

.TP
.B selectTactic(ship: Ship, enemies: Ship[]) -> Tactic
Choose combat tactic (Attack, Dodge, or Retreat) based on situation.

.TP
.B allocatePower(ship: Ship, tactic: Tactic, enemies: Ship[]) -> PowerAllocation
Distribute ship's PD among drive, beam, screen, and tubes.

.TP
.B assignDamage(ship: Ship, damage: int) -> DamageAssignment
Choose which attributes absorb damage.

